  <name>kodesk</name>
  <summary>Update, extend and tune KOReader on your e-reader</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      kodesk is a desktop companion for e-readers running KOReader. Plug your reader in,
      then update KOReader, add community plugins and patches, and tune how your reader looks,
      without breaking the setup you carefully built.
    </p>
    <p>Every change is previewed first and backed up by a snapshot you can restore with one click.</p>
  </description>
